_ds/
support.js
.thumbnail
*.dc.html

# Duplicate of index.html emitted one directory too deep
work/

# SOURCE DOCUMENTS — DO NOT PUBLISH.
# informe-arquitectura-ep.pdf is the INTERNAL architecture report. It contains
# database role names, schema names, loopback ports, auth scheme and VM detail.
# The case study itself states that in a privacy system the configuration is
# part of the attack surface; publishing this PDF would contradict that.
uploads/
